{
  "rationale": "The plant separates motion commands from perception. The specification binds perception outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforcing conservative recovery and rapid return to exploration. Recovery states are one-shot and only reached on obstacle events. All uncontrollable events are handled in every state. The supervisor always enables exactly one controllable per state, prioritizing forward progress when safe.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for motion and perception to reflect open-loop actuation and asynchronous sensing.",
    "Specification automaton encodes safe, conservative obstacle recovery and ensures steady exploration progress, with one-shot recovery and rapid return to forward movement."
